# Component name normalization

Canonical implementation: `tooling/scripts/lib/name.mjs`.

Canonical slug regex:

- `^[a-z][a-z0-9]*(_[a-z][a-z0-9]*)*$`

File regexes:

- Markdown: `^[a-z][a-z0-9]*(_[a-z][a-z0-9]*)*\\.md$`
- Spec YAML: `^[a-z][a-z0-9]*(_[a-z][a-z0-9]*)*\\.yml$`

Deterministic path contract:

- Spec YAML: `docs/_spec/components/<snake_case>.yml`
- Markdown: `docs/components/<snake_case>.md`
- Explicit CLI paths override inferred paths.

The normalization algorithm (token boundaries, acronym handling, digit handling, and invalid-token removal) is defined in `tooling/scripts/lib/name.mjs` and must not be reimplemented ad hoc.

Validation and code semantics (`NAME01`, `NAME02`) are centralized in `error-codes.mdc` and `.agents/rules/_manifest.yml` (`checks`).
